==== hyperbricks yaml {!{image}} ====
image:
  - type: image
  - alt: Cute cat!
  - enclose: <div id="#gallery">|</div>
  - src: hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/cute_cat.jpg
  - width: "100"
==== explainer ====
Alternative text for the image
